{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">New Experience</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lastbane is developed to offer you a different kind of online horror experience. Even while communicating with your friends using 3D voice, you must stay quiet. Every step you take can be heard by the creatures around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431220/extras/1.gif?t=1752848258\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">CO-OP Multiplayer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlike traditional horror games, this 1-4 player game requires you to work with your teammates to find all possible items on the map, complete objectives, and execute your escape plan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431220/extras/2.gif?t=1752848258\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Immersive Experience</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Realistic graphics, minimal user interface, and a gloomy atmosphere will deliver a truly immersive experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431220/extras/3.gif?t=1752848258\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3431220?t=1752848258","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3431220?t=1752848258","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431220/994b3749daba718fd20657102b86ad1abfd271f3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752848258","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431220/994b3749daba718fd20657102b86ad1abfd27